# {{.Name}} — web app package

An Astro (Svelte + Tailwind) frontend embedded in a Go module. `{{.Package}}.New` builds the app, and `Mount` serves
its routes and the built `dist/`. `apps/{{.Name}}` runs it.

## Ports

- App (Go HTTP server): **{{.AppPort}}**, in `apps/{{.Name}}/cmd/{{.Name}}` and `apps/{{.Name}}/cmd/{{.Name}}-dev`
- Astro dev server: **{{.AstroPort}}**, in `astro.config.mjs`

## Setup

```sh
make install    # once: Go modules, pnpm dependencies and a placeholder dist/index.html
```

## Development

Run it through the app runner in `apps/{{.Name}}`:

```sh
cd ../../apps/{{.Name}}
make dev        # astro (background) + air hot reload → http://localhost:{{.AppPort}}
make web        # astro dev server only → http://localhost:{{.AstroPort}}
make stop       # stop the background astro server
```

## Check

```sh
make check      # builds the pages, then checks the formatting, vets, tests and builds the Go code
```

How it works: `knowledge/index.md`.
